{"sha": "b2b822972dcf13b87051c85fb541ec6a464fefa5e37b78644db0dafdcdfb962b", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:lebesgue:12}", "(a) 在 $\\intoo0n$ 上，$\\varphi_n(x) = n\\log(1 - \\frac xn)$", "关于 $n$ 递增并趋于 $-x$（映射 $t \\mapsto", "\\frac{\\log(1 - xt)}{t}$ 随 $t = \\frac1n", "\\downarrow 0$ 时递减；或直接展开，$\\varphi_{n}' \\geq 0$ 对 $n$ 成立，借助", "$\\log(1-u) + \\frac{u}{1-u} \\geq 0$）。于是 $(1 -", "\\frac xn)^n\\eu^{x/2}\\mathbf 1_{x<n} \\nearrow", "\\eu^{-x/2}$，由单调收敛定理得", "\\[", "\\lim_n\\int_0^n\\Bigl(1 - \\frac xn\\Bigr)^n\\eu^{x/2}\\dd x =", "\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-x/2}\\dd x = 2 .", "\\]", "", "(b) 作代换 $u = x^n$（$x = u^{1/n}$，$n x^{n-1}\\dd x =", "\\dd u$）：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1\\frac{nx^{n-1}}{1 + x}\\dd x =", "\\int_0^1\\frac{\\dd u}{1 + u^{1/n}} .", "\\]", "当 $u \\in \\intoo01$ 时，$u^{1/n} \\to 1$，故被积函数", "趋于 $\\frac12$，被 $1$ 控制，极限为", "$\\frac12$（由控制收敛定理）。（$nx^{n-1}$ 的质量集中在 $x", "= 1$ 处，即 $\\frac1{1+x} = \\frac12$：换元使", "集中现象清晰可见。）", "", "(c) 逐点地，$(1 + x/n)^n \\nearrow \\eu^x$ 且 $x^{1/n} \\to", "1$（$x > 0$），被积函数趋于 $\\eu^{-x}$。控制函数", "当 $n \\geq 2$ 时：在 $\\intoc01$ 上，$x^{-1/n} \\leq x^{-1/2}$ 且", "$(1 + x/n)^{-n} \\leq 1$：控制为 $x^{-1/2}$，可积；在", "$\\intoo1\\infty$ 上，$x^{-1/n} \\leq 1$ 且 $(1 + x/n)^n \\geq 1 +", "\\binom n2\\frac{x^2}{n^2} \\geq 1 + \\frac{x^2}4$：控制为", "$\\frac{4}{4 + x^2}$，可积。由控制收敛定理得：", "\\[", "\\lim_n\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\dd x}{(1 + x/n)^nx^{1/n}} =", "\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-x}\\dd x = 1 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:lebesgue:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $A$ 是 $\\mathcal C^1$ 的，这由微积分基本定理及", "链式法则可得：$A'(t) =", "2\\eu^{-t^2}\\int_0^t\\eu^{-x^2}\\dd x$。对 $B$：", "$\\partial_t\\bigl(\\frac{\\eu^{-t^2(1+x^2)}}{1+x^2}\\bigr) =", "-2t\\,\\eu^{-t^2(1+x^2)}$，在 $[t_0, T]", "\\times \\intcc01$ 上连续且有界，对任意 $0 < t_0 < T$ 成立（有限", "测度空间上的有界控制即可）：$B$ 是 $\\mathcal C^1$ 函数，", "在 $\\intoo0{+\\infty}$ 上，其导数为", "\\[", "B'(t) = -2t\\int_0^1 \\eu^{-t^2(1+x^2)}\\dd x", "= -2\\eu^{-t^2}\\int_0^1 t\\,\\eu^{-(tx)^2}\\dd x", "= -2\\eu^{-t^2}\\int_0^t\\eu^{-u^2}\\dd u = -A'(t)", "\\]", "（作代换 $u = tx$）。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $A(0) = 0$，且 $B(0) = \\int_0^1\\frac{\\dd x}{1+x^2}", "= \\frac\\pi4$。$A + B$ 的导数在", "$\\intoo0{+\\infty}$ 上为零，且在 $0$ 处连续（$B$ 由", "以 $\\frac1{1+x^2}$ 为控制，并", "借助\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:paramcont}）：$A + B \\equiv \\frac\\pi4$。", "当 $t\\to+\\infty$ 时：$0 \\leq B(t) \\leq \\eu^{-t^2} \\to 0$，且", "$A(t) \\to \\bigl(\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-x^2}\\dd x\\bigr)^2$（由单调收敛定理，或", "仅对内层积分用单调收敛）。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 因此 $\\bigl(\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-x^2}\\dd x\\bigr)^2", "= \\frac\\pi4$，故 $\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-x^2}\\dd x =", "\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2$，由偶性得 $G = \\sqrt\\pi$。又", "$\\Gamma(\\frac12) = \\int_0^\\infty x^{-1/2}\\eu^{-x}\\dd x", "\\overset{x = u^2}{=} 2\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-u^2}\\dd u =", "\\sqrt\\pi$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} 当 $t > 0$ 时：$\\abs{\\eu^{-tx}\\frac{\\sin x}x} \\leq", "\\eu^{-tx}$，可积。当 $t = 0$ 时需考察广义收敛：在", "$[\\pi, A]$ 上，", "\\[", "\\int_\\pi^A\\frac{\\sin x}x\\dd x", "= \\Bigl[-\\frac{\\cos x}x\\Bigr]_\\pi^A -", "\\int_\\pi^A\\frac{\\cos x}{x^2}\\dd x,", "\\]", "两项当 $A \\to \\infty$ 时均收敛；在 $0$ 附近，被积函数", "可连续延拓为 $1$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 在 $[t_0, +\\infty)$ 上（$t_0 > 0$）：", "$\\abs{\\partial_t\\bigl(\\eu^{-tx}\\tfrac{\\sin x}x\\bigr)} =", "\\eu^{-tx}\\abs{\\sin x} \\leq \\eu^{-t_0x}$，可积：", "\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:paramdiff} 在每个此类", "区间上均适用，因此在整个 $\\intoo0{+\\infty}$ 上：", "\\[", "F'(t) = -\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-tx}\\sin x\\,\\dd x", "= -\\operatorname{Im}\\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-(t - \\iu)x}\\dd x", "= -\\operatorname{Im}\\frac{1}{t - \\iu} = -\\frac{1}{1 + t^2}.", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\abs{F(t)} \\leq \\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-tx}\\dd x =", "\\frac1t \\to 0$。积分 $F' = -\\frac1{1+t^2}$ 得 $F(t) = C -", "\\arctan t$，由 $t \\to \\infty$ 知 $C = \\frac\\pi2$：$F(t) =", "\\frac\\pi2 - \\arctan t$，在 $\\intoo0{+\\infty}$ 上成立。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 在 $[A, R]$ 上分部积分，取 $\\sin x =", "(-\\cos x)'$，并令 $R \\to \\infty$：", "\\[", "\\int_A^{\\infty}\\eu^{-tx}\\frac{\\sin x}x\\dd x", "= \\frac{\\cos A\\;\\eu^{-tA}}{A}", "- \\int_A^\\infty \\cos x\\,\\Bigl(\\frac tx +", "\\frac1{x^2}\\Bigr)\\eu^{-tx}\\dd x .", "\\]", "放缩 $\\abs{\\cos} \\leq 1$：第一项 $\\leq \\frac1A$；", "积分至多为 $\\int_A^\\infty t\\eu^{-tx}\\frac{\\dd x}x", "+ \\int_A^\\infty\\frac{\\dd x}{x^2} \\leq \\frac1A\\int_0^\\infty", "t\\eu^{-tx}\\dd x + \\frac1A = \\frac2A$。合计 $\\leq \\frac 3A$，", "对 $t \\in [0, 1]$ 一致成立（包括 $t = 0$ 的情形）。现在", "\\[", "\\abs{F(t) - D} \\leq", "\\Bigl|\\int_0^A(\\eu^{-tx} - 1)\\,\\frac{\\sin x}x\\,\\dd x\\Bigr| +", "\\frac6A .", "\\]", "在 $[0, A]$ 上：$\\abs{\\eu^{-tx} - 1} \\leq tx \\leq tA$，且", "$\\abs{\\frac{\\sin x}x} \\leq 1$，故第一项至多为", "$tA^2$。取 $A$ 使 $\\frac6A < \\varepsilon$，再取 $t <", "\\varepsilon/A^2$，则 $\\abs{F(t) - D} < 2\\varepsilon$。", ""]}